msgid ""
"<h1>Alternatives Configuration</h1>"
"\n"
"This modules allows you to configure the system alternatives in Debian/Fedora/Mandriva/openSUSE/Ubuntu distributions."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Alternativen instellen</h1>"
"\n"
"Mit dit Moduul kannst Du de Systeem-Alternativen bi de Distributschonen Debian, Fedora, Mandriva, openSUSE un Ubuntu instellen."

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QTreeView, m_altList)
#. +> trunk
