#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_hideAlt)
#. +> trunk
#: src/mainwindow.ui:67
msgid "If this option is active, all the alternative groups with only one alternative available will be hidden from the list."
msgstr "Is dit anmaakt, warrt all Alternativen-Koppeln mit bloots een Alternatiev dor binnen nich op de List wiest."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_hideAlt)
#. +> trunk
#: src/mainwindow.ui:70
